# 6. MARKET API SERVICE

Create a server-side market service:

```text
src/lib/api/market.ts
```

Responsibilities:

* fetch market data
* fetch token detail
* fetch historical market data
* normalize external API responses
* handle API errors
* handle missing values
* handle rate limits
* provide typed return values

The React components should NOT know the raw CoinGecko response structure.

Bad:

```text
Component
  ↓
CoinGecko raw JSON
```

Good:

```text
Component
  ↓
NEXORA Market type
  ↓
Market service
  ↓
CoinGecko
```

---

