10. POSITION MANAGEMENT

Setiap open position harus memiliki:

interface PaperPosition {
  id: string;
  symbol: string;
  quantity: number;
  averageEntryPrice: number;
  currentPrice: number;
  marketValue: number;
  unrealizedPnl: number;
  unrealizedPnlPercent: number;
}

Position harus dihitung berdasarkan market price terbaru.

11. AVERAGE ENTRY PRICE

Jika user membeli asset beberapa kali:

Contoh:

BUY 1 ETH @ $2,000
BUY 1 ETH @ $3,000

Maka:

Quantity = 2 ETH
Average Entry = $2,500

Gunakan weighted average:

averageEntry =
(total cost) / total quantity

Jangan menggunakan transaksi terakhir sebagai entry price.

12. UNREALIZED PNL

Unrealized PnL:

(current price - average entry price) × quantity

Contoh:

Entry = $2,500
Current = $2,700
Quantity = 2

Maka:

Unrealized PnL = $400

Persentase:

(current price - average entry) / average entry × 100
13. REALIZED PNL

Ketika position ditutup atau sebagian dijual:

Realized PnL =
(sell price - average entry price) × sold quantity

Contoh:

Entry = $2,500
Sell = $2,700
Quantity = 1

Maka:

Realized PnL = +$200

Realized PnL harus disimpan dalam trading statistics.

14. TRADE HISTORY

Tampilkan seluruh transaksi simulasi.

Interface:

interface PaperTrade {
  id: string;
  timestamp: string;
